# Coding

- Match existing style, naming, and patterns in nearby files.
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones.
- Avoid drive-by refactors unrelated to the task.
- TypeScript: keep types honest; avoid `any` unless matching local style.
- React: follow repo React Compiler guidance; do not add `useMemo`/`useCallback` by default.
